WEBVTT

00:11.928 --> 00:13.972
ZOMBIE APOCALYPSE IN KOREA

00:15.932 --> 00:17.809
HELLO
I'M ALWAYS ROOTING FOR YOU!

00:17.892 --> 00:20.395
DID SOMETHING HAPPEN IN HYOSAN?
WHY ARE YOU GOING TO HYOSAN?

00:20.478 --> 00:22.605
MY DAD IS FROM HYOSAN
IS THIS THE BEGINNING?

00:22.689 --> 00:25.650
I'VE BEEN WAITING FOR TODAY
ZOMBIES?

00:25.734 --> 00:28.611
FINALLY
HE'S REALLY GOING

00:28.695 --> 00:30.029
I'LL BE BACK
WHAT CAR DO YOU DRIVE?

00:30.113 --> 00:31.948
I HAVE TO WATCH THIS LIVE
WORKING HARD FOR SUBS

00:32.032 --> 00:33.700
ORANGE LOOKS GOOD ON YOU
WHY ARE YOU GOING?

00:33.783 --> 00:36.578
ZOMBIELAND!
WHAT'S WITH THE TRAFFIC?

00:50.049 --> 00:52.594
DID YOU DITCH YOUR CAR?
ARE YOU GOING ON A HIKE?

00:52.677 --> 00:55.054
DAMN, HE REALLY WENT!
ARE YOU NUTS, ORANGE?

00:55.138 --> 00:57.891
IS HYOSAN OKAY?
I CAN'T GET A HOLD OF MY FRIEND

00:57.974 --> 01:00.977
WHERE DID YOU PARK YOUR CAR?
ONWARDS TO ZOMBIELAND!

01:01.061 --> 01:04.105
PREPARING HIS FUNERAL LOL
A ZOMBIE VIRUS BROKE OUT THERE

01:04.189 --> 01:06.900
IT LOOKED REAL ON INSTAGRAM
WHAT'S GOING ON AT HYOSAN?

01:06.983 --> 01:09.527
I WANT TO TAG ALONG!
WHAT ABOUT GLOVES?

01:09.611 --> 01:12.280
DON'T LOSE YOUR ORANGE LEAF
SHOULDN'T YOU WEAR A MASK?

01:12.363 --> 01:14.824
WHAT ZOMBIE? IT'S JUST A VIRUS
PLEASE SAY HELLO TO MY GRANDMA

01:14.908 --> 01:17.368
WHERE IS HYOSAN?
WHAT YOU NEED MOST IS A NECK GUARD

01:17.452 --> 01:19.662
IF YOU GO THERE, DON'T COME BACK
WATCH YOUR ORANGES

01:19.746 --> 01:21.831
IT'S JUST A VIRUS
KEEP YOUR MASK ON AT ALL TIMES

01:21.915 --> 01:24.667
AN EVACUATION ORDER WAS ISSUED
ALL THE ROADS TO HYOSAN ARE CLOSED

01:24.751 --> 01:26.836
MY MOM TOLD ME TO STAY HOME
LOOK AT YOU ALL GEARED UP

01:26.920 --> 01:28.379
REST IN PEACE
WHERE IS HE?

01:28.463 --> 01:31.549
RUN! RUN FASTER!
IS THAT REALLY A ZOMBIE?

01:31.633 --> 01:33.426
RUN AWAY!
THIS IS SCRIPTED, ISN'T IT?

01:33.510 --> 01:35.428
YOU'D MAKE A GREAT SCREENWRITER
WHEN IS THIS OVER?

01:36.638 --> 01:38.473
IT SHOULD BE OVER SOON
THIS FOOTAGE WILL HELP US

01:39.808 --> 01:42.352
HIS ACTING IS ON POINT
THIS IS SUPER EXCITING

01:42.435 --> 01:45.522
WHERE ARE THE POLICE?
TAKE OUT YOUR AXE!

01:45.605 --> 01:48.608
WE CAN'T SEE ANYTHING!
WHAT DID WE SEE JUST NOW?

01:48.691 --> 01:50.777
SHOW US THE STREET
YOUR AXE IS USELESS

01:56.074 --> 01:58.576
I DON'T THINK I CAN SLEEP TONIGHT
YOU SURE HAVE SOME BALLS

01:58.660 --> 02:01.538
CAN YOU SHOW US MORE CLEARLY?
I SAY HE'S SCREWED

02:01.621 --> 02:04.999
CAN HE DO MARTIAL ARTS?
JUST RUN AWAY

02:05.083 --> 02:06.960
IT'S SCARY
WHERE ARE THE REAL ZOMBIES?

02:07.043 --> 02:11.005
ZOMBIELAND! AWESOME!
IS IT OKAY FOR HIM TO BE THERE?

02:11.089 --> 02:12.924
YOU SHOULD'VE TAKEN A GUN
IT'S A ZOMBIE!

14:57.021 --> 14:58.022
MUSIC 3

24:38.894 --> 24:41.980
ANYONE ALIVE?
WHY DID YOU GO TO HELL?

24:42.063 --> 24:44.858
HOW DID YOU EVEN GET IN THERE?
WHAT DID WE JUST SEE?

24:44.941 --> 24:47.903
HE'S GONE TOO FAR
IT'S SCARY AS HELL

24:47.986 --> 24:50.989
YOU LOOK HAGGARD LOL
I'LL SUBSCRIBE TO YOUR CHANNEL

24:51.072 --> 24:53.408
HE REALLY WENT THERE?
HE'S AWESOME

24:53.491 --> 24:56.745
WHY VOLUNTARILY WALK INTO HELL?
NO MORE ZOMBIES?

24:56.828 --> 24:59.915
COVID-19 SPREAD BECAUSE OF PEOPLE LIKE YOU
YOU THINK THIS IS FUN?

24:59.998 --> 25:03.501
QUIET DOWN! YOU'RE BEING TOO LOUD!
LET'S HIT THE LIKE BUTTON, PEOPLE

25:03.585 --> 25:06.421
LET ME CALL THE POLICE FOR YOU
MOM, I WANT TO BE ORANGE WHEN I GROW UP

25:06.504 --> 25:09.382
IS THIS REAL?
I RESPECT YOU, BROTHER

25:09.466 --> 25:12.510
I JUST GOT OFF WORK, STILL STREAMING?
THAT MORON LOL

25:12.594 --> 25:15.680
IS HE INFECTED?
WHERE'S YOUR BADASS AXE?

25:15.764 --> 25:18.850
YOUR MOM WANTS YOU TO STAY HOME
HERE LIES ORANGE

25:18.934 --> 25:21.603
MY CONDOLENCES
WHO LITTERED THERE LOL

25:21.686 --> 25:24.981
LET'S NOT GO THERE
ZOMBIES ARE LIVING CORPSES

25:33.073 --> 25:35.492
IS HE GOING TO TURN INTO A ZOMBIE?
I REALLY NEED TO SLEEP…

25:35.575 --> 25:38.620
I CAN'T TURN THIS OFF
COME BACK

25:38.703 --> 25:41.998
MY HEART'S RACING
I HATE ZOMBIES

25:42.082 --> 25:45.669
THE SOUND MAKES IT SCARIER
IT'LL BE FULL OF ZOMBIES IN THERE

25:45.752 --> 25:48.421
YOU'RE WORKING HARD
SHOULD'VE BROUGHT A GUN

25:48.505 --> 25:51.424
WHY'D YOU GO TO HELL?
STRAIGHT TO HELL

25:51.508 --> 25:54.427
YOU SHOULD HIDE
STOP GOING

25:54.511 --> 25:57.430
BE CAREFUL
WHAT IF THEY'RE IN THERE?

25:57.514 --> 26:00.392
IT'S EMPTY, SPEND THE NIGHT
DON'T MAKE A SOUND!

26:00.475 --> 26:03.353
ARE WE GOING TO WATCH HIM TURN?
WHY WOULD YOU GO THERE…

26:03.436 --> 26:06.439
I'M SCARED…
SAFETY FIRST!

26:06.523 --> 26:09.067
IT'S TOO DARK…
IT'S NOT TOO LATE TO RUN…

26:09.150 --> 26:12.028
CAN YOU BELIEVE HOW MANY ARE WATCHING?
IT'S BETTER THAN A THRILLER

26:12.112 --> 26:15.448
THANKS FOR EVERYTHING
BYE BYE

26:15.532 --> 26:18.535
I HEAR SOMETHING
WHAT IS IT?

26:18.618 --> 26:21.329
ALL THIS JUST FOR LIKES AND SUBSCRIBERS
HE'S DONE FOR

26:21.413 --> 26:23.415
YOU'RE INSANE
CUTE ZOMBIES LOL

26:23.498 --> 26:26.167
RUN! RUN!
I WANT TO GO THERE TOO

26:31.423 --> 26:33.591
SO SCARY
IT'S ALL FAKE ANYWAY LOL

26:33.675 --> 26:35.719
I'M SCARED
KEEP STREAMING!

26:35.802 --> 26:37.679
WHAT THE HELL IS HAPPENING?
ZOMBIES!

26:42.267 --> 26:43.727
IS THIS FOR REAL?
DAMN!

28:16.986 --> 28:20.407
SCHOOL VIOLENCE RESOLUTION COMMITTEE

36:15.756 --> 36:17.884
RESTRICTED AREA

42:47.606 --> 42:50.734
INTERNATIONAL SIGNAL FLAGS
INTERNATIONAL DISTRESS SIGNALS

45:02.241 --> 45:04.535
NEW POST

45:04.618 --> 45:06.954
SCHEDULE SETTINGS

45:07.037 --> 45:11.208
PROCESSING…

53:12.689 --> 53:13.899
GWI-NAM
UPLOAD

01:09:19.697 --> 01:09:24.910
ALL CHARACTERS, LOCATIONS, ORGANIZATIONS,
AND EVENTS IN THIS SHOW ARE FICTIONAL.

01:09:24.994 --> 01:09:29.999
Subtitle translation by: Jeong Lee
